{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_70","type":"agent_message","text":"The transposed expert grid is neutral for the main shapes but improves the 8192-token routed-down stage. The next optimization keeps one program per expert tile while treating its 128 rows as two 64-row halves: expert weights are loaded once, but the second matrix-core half is skipped when an expert has at most 64 routes. This removes padding without the costly extra bucket launch."}}
